<!-- A world copy of Incoterms 2020: the codes the world uses, and others of the same list. No machine-readable copy of the source could be kept (ICC Incoterms 2020 (ICC publication 723E; the rules' three-letter names as the ICC publishes them)); the codes and names are as the standard publishes them. Made by tools/build_codelists.py from world/codelists/lists.json. -->
